// spec: a strong type converts to nothing and nothing converts to it without a cast (design.md 33): not a number (a literal either), not another strong type of the same underlying type, not a strong bool to bool outside a condition; it has arithmetic and comparisons with its own type only, and a strong bool has no arithmetic
